    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Canadian generative artist and creative coder based in London. Independent art practice (long-form generative works like Meridian, Pattern Language, Subscapes; sells prints via mattdesl.studio; LUMOS installation at Ontario Place 2018) plus widely-used open-source creative-coding tools (canvas-sketch). Spoke at Figma Config 2025; created Bitframes (crowdfund for generative art documentary). Practice includes generative 2D, motion graphics, and 3D moving images, supporting Creative technology + Art practice + 3D & motion tags. Very senior independent practitioner, ~10+ yrs, world-class in the generative/creative-coding niche; effectively self-directing (Autonomy 5). Freelance/independent: own site + studio shop self-maintained and current, no employer signal (site + no employer signal = Freelance). IG handle @mattdesl_art confirmed via his own site. Public email info@mattdesl.studio found on mattdesl.com contact page. IG context screenshot blocked headless (blank page); queued to ig-queue.json for logged-in ig.py grab.",
